a://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.iBzgKzPXt7MI9CNU","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.iBzgKzPXt7MI9CNU"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"audiobooks","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=audiobooks"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=fantasy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"favorites","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=favorites"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"hate-to-love","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=hate-to-love"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7598576426"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.JKiB3gV3hoMY8Mb44tOFTQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.JKiB3gV3hoMY8Mb44tOFTQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:84801697"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1782305059869,"createdAt":1762457658620,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1776605855643,"text":"✅ Characters\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Multiple POVs (with Lara, Aren, Keris, and Zarrah, too!)\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Pace\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Plot and plot twists\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Politics and betrayals\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Romance / Hate to love (kind of)\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Smut\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"8411f45d-cf60-4fb2-a61d-f54ef2d3aa86\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"8411f45d-cf60-4fb2-a61d-f54ef2d3aa86\"\u003e✅ Veliant assemble moment\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e❗️❗️Trigger warnings: death of loved ones, people getting eaten by sharks, poisoning, decapitation, imprisonment, some physical abuse, and non-con sexual touches (brief and not too detailed)\u003cbr /\u003e🔥 Spice level : 🌶️🌶️🌶️.5 / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat an epic and perfect ending to the series.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDanielle Jensen spoiled us this year with two epic finales to her series. What a great year for her, and for us!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThis book is a wild ride.\u003c/b\u003e A roller-coaster of emotions with a fast pace. It starts where the previous book left off, and the action, scheming, and politics don’t stop until the very end. The plot of this final book is more complex than those of the previous books, and it involves all the nations, both North and South of the bridge. We see how the relationships built in the earlier books affect what happens in this one, and every leader has a role to play.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThis duology has more politics than the ones before, and Harrendel’s court is the champion at scheming and double-crossing.\u003c/b\u003e There are many plot twists and betrayals in this final book. Some I saw coming, and others that took me completely by surprise. The villains in this book are great because they are not just power-hungry or evil; they are clever and patient (but they do get what they deserve in the end, thankfully).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eAhnna and James are still the main couple in this book, but Lara and Aren, as well as Keris and Zarrah, play a part in the plot.\u003c/b\u003e They have their chapters too, and I absolutely loved it. It was a great way to say goodbye to all those characters we grew to love over the years. Keris was even more present than Laran, Aren, and Zarrah, to my joy, because I love him so much. I think he is my favorite male lead in this series. Also, the epilogue was heartwarming and perfect.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eAhnna, just like Lara and Zarrah, is a strong and inspiring woman, and I liked her more in this book than in the previous one.\u003c/b\u003e The author has a way to create strong, bold, and brave female leads that show everyone around them that women can be as fierce and dangerous as men. Ahnna had to push aside her anger and betrayal to work in a team with James if she had any hope of surviving Amarid. She showed her emotional strength and her cleverness when it came to fighting against Harrendel and Amarid’s lies and schemes. I said in my review of the previous book that Ahnna felt naïve and clueless at times. Well, she showed in this book that she is to be taken seriously and that she will not be used by Harendell a second time.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe romance was better in this book. \u003c/b\u003eI felt more chemistry between Ahnna and James once James decided to believe Ahnna, and she managed to forgive him. Since they didn’t have to hide their feelings anymore, it allowed them to have more serious and meaningful conversations. Ahnna also didn’t spend her time doing the opposite of what James suggested, so they managed to work better as a team than in the previous book. That being said, while I enjoyed the chemistry and intensity between the couples in this series, I am too pragmatic to enjoy some smutty moments that happen in the most inappropriate moments or places. I love to feel the sexual tension when I read a book, but there are still moments when it’s just not the time for sex…\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was hoping for more grovelling, but the quick forgiveness also fits with Ahnna’s logical side and the fact that James and she were fighting and running for their lives. Still, the angst lover in me is not 100% satisfied, so I will have to find something else to read to scratch that itch, since it’s my second book in a row that doesn’t fully deliver on the grovelling.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTruly, this was a great ending to an amazing series, and I highly recommend it to all romantasy lovers looking for their next addictive series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e1. \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3092085305\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Bridge Kingdom\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e2. \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3475481063\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Traitor Queen\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e3. \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3614393540\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Inadequate Heir\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e3.5 \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4749398051\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Calm Before the Storm\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e4. \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4030447672\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Endless War\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐.5\u003cbr /\u003e5. \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6747279377\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Twisted Throne\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lucie_v_booklover/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFollow me on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e 🙂","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.iBzgKzPXt7MI9CNU\"}}"},"likeCount":73,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":12},"User:90586539":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":90586539,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1763254562i/90586539._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":9533,"textReviewsCount":389,"name":"Ali L","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/90586539-ali-l","contributor":null,"id":90586539},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A11GCY5L7ZZ5RL":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A11GCY5L7ZZ5RL"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A11GCY5L7ZZ5RL\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A11GCY5L7ZZ5RL","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A11GCY5L7ZZ5RL"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/90586539?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8713765346"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.MWsYWpQY3qbqEBv6Y72NsA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.MWsYWpQY3qbqEBv6Y72NsA","creator":{"__ref":"User:90586539"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1785742858300,"createdAt":1784231780620,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1784234272173,"text":"Featuring POVs from every character you’ve ever met, this book is the final installment of a six-book series that briefly but gloriously occupied my every waking thought. Aren remains the king of the himbos, Lara the queen who does all the work; Keris the king of the pretend himbos, Zarrah the empress who does a lot of the work; and now James, the prince of “does my entire family suck out loud?” and Ahnna, who wonders the same thing (in-laws, am I right?). There’s a lot going on here — poisonings, stabbing, ships, people almost dying fifteen or sixteen times, fight scenes that probably could have been thirty or so pages shorter — and still somehow it’s not enough because saying goodbye to these bloodthirsty rulers with hearts of gold is bittersweet. Dippy is still my baby, but don’t discount Fiona — beneath that fluff lies the heart of a warrior. With a jeweled collar. ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A11GCY5L7ZZ5RL\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW\"}}"},"likeCount":66,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:175005654":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":175005654,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1714068905i/175005654._UX200_CR0,18,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":80,"name":"Alessia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/175005654-alessia","contributor":null,"id":175005654},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A7I5U7KK3JLDX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A7I5U7KK3JLDX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A7I5U7KK3JLDX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.UhwBNkIxkgmo5Uqa\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A7I5U7KK3JLDX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A7I5U7KK3JLDX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.UhwBNkIxkgmo5Uqa","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.UhwBNkIxkgmo5Uqa"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/175005654?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7266488297"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.bXOet2yqb-Vd2r-LFPSGww":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.bXOet2yqb-Vd2r-LFPSGww","creator":{"__ref":"User:175005654"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1779778946876,"createdAt":1738090131234,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1738090154429,"text":"I don't want this series to end pleeeease 😭😭","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSourc