o wrap everything up in one book but alas, she pulled it off!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI'm going to join every other review in saying that before things for our characters get good here, they get REALLY bad. Like we open up from the end of The Twisted Throne with shit hitting the fan and that really just snowballs for the rest of the book. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis series has gotten heavier on the politics as it's progressed and this book is no exception. Almost too much in my opinion- I understand why all of it was necessary but I do think it weighed the story down a bit. Having to see our characters do something and then have four other povs hear about that event but from different sources and interpret them differently and try to figure out the schemes involved was a bit exhausting. Like every character here learned about King Edward's death, had their own opinions, then those would change with new information, they would get at \u003ci\u003ewhy/i\u0026gt; it happened, change those opinions again. At a certain point I just wanted to get on with it. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book also made me try and question the population of Ithicana. Because seriously, how many mass casualty events can those people go through in one series and still have warriors ready to fight!?\u003c/i\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A7O0RCIF38Z7Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW\"}}"},"likeCount":13,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:29587393":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":29587393,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1727031157i/29587393._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":10,"textReviewsCount":206,"name":"kirsten","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/29587393-kirsten","contributor":null,"id":29587393},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2ZRH6CQFF0Y5K":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2ZRH6CQFF0Y5K"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2ZRH6CQFF0Y5K\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2ZRH6CQFF0Y5K","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2ZRH6CQFF0Y5K"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29587393?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8086774779"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ZjIOE-4r_eObSIMo176nQQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ZjIOE-4r_eObSIMo176nQQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:29587393"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1783985351117,"createdAt":1763662323706,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1763662344880,"text":"I was SO excited for this book, but the fact that I finished this audiobook on 2x speed—and wondered several times whether I could just skip a chapter or two, including the smut!—tells me that it was too long and far too overwritten.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved that we got a final book with the return of all of our favorite characters and their points of view. I loved the overarching conflict and the over-the-top scheming and villainy. The first quarter or so hooked me, but the execution of the rest just didn’t hit for me.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book had so many “all is lost” beats/moments that they lost all meaning or shock value. Additional POVs were integrated, but besides Keris’s, they felt too scattered/purposeless and disappeared too soon. The smut came at wildly inappropriate moments, the pacing felt off at times, and the epilogue was giving nothing. Ultimately, I think this wanted to be a story that tied all of the characters back in, but it had so much work to do with the primary couple, and took so many pages to do it, that it didn’t quite work to attempt both things at once.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere’s also the Herondale of it all, which wound up being a society of generally unbearable bigots who don’t really deserve anything they got from this story or its ending? \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, as desperately as I wanted to love this series, I just don’t think the magic of this world ever hit as hard after the first 3 books. I’d recommend the first duology and call it a day.","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2ZRH6CQFF0Y5K\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW\"}}"},"likeCount":11,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:135754305":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":135754305,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1749871274i/135754305._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":7,"textReviewsCount":134,"name":"Jaimie Elowsky","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/135754305-jaimie-elowsky","contributor":null,"id":135754305},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1V2JYHLQIG9EA":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1V2JYHLQIG9EA"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1V2JYHLQIG9EA\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1V2JYHLQIG9EA","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1V2JYHLQIG9EA"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LpcMWCLKPKNoeidW"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"acti